%% Existing request flows relevant to tasks A/B/C (observed in code, Stage 00).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Company admin (browser)
    participant FE as React SPA
    participant API as DRF APIView
    participant DB as Postgres

    Note over Admin,DB: Login
    Admin->>FE: email + password
    FE->>API: POST /api/auth/login/
    API->>DB: authenticate, get_or_create Token
    API-->>FE: {token, user{role}} stored in localStorage

    Note over Admin,DB: Approval flow (Task A relies on this)
    FE->>API: GET /api/timesheets/?status=submitted
    API->>DB: filter contract__company = admin.company
    API-->>FE: [{id, contract(id), date, hours, status, rejection_reason}]
    FE->>API: PATCH /api/timesheets/{id}/ {status, rejection_reason?}
    API->>DB: get entry scoped to company, reason required if rejected
    Note right of API: No role or transition check.<br/>Writable contract FK (probe-confirmed gaps)
    API-->>FE: 200 updated entry

    Note over Admin,DB: Billing flow (Task B) - stubbed
    FE->>API: POST /api/billing/runs/ {month: YYYY-MM}
    API-->>FE: 200 {run_id: stub, invoices_generated: 0}
    FE->>API: GET /api/invoices/?month=YYYY-MM
    API-->>FE: 200 []
    FE->>API: GET /api/invoices/{id}/
    API-->>FE: 404

    Note over Admin,DB: Developer settings (Task C) - stubbed
    FE->>API: POST /api/webhook-endpoints/ {url}
    API-->>FE: 200 {id: stub, url, active: true} (nothing persisted)
    FE->>API: GET /api/webhook-endpoints/
    API-->>FE: 200 []
